0..72 Comment "// The refusals of a stated law, the generator cell no conversion fills."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..153 Comment "// A model owes the cell\'s component with no default. A capability scope owes"
154..196 Comment "// the cell too, read through its clauses."
197..199 Comment "//"
200..276 Comment "// A model of the naturals under addition, one object and its numbers as the"
277..356 Comment "// cells, leaving the associator out is refused `NoFiller.Omitted` by its name."
357..430 Comment "// Addition recurses on its second argument, so the two nestings of three"
431..498 Comment "// variables do not convert and `Path.here` does not fill the cell."
499..515 Comment "// A scope whose"
516..594 Comment "// clauses tell a stated law\'s sides apart is refused `HandlerUnlawful` naming"
595..606 Comment "// the law."
